# Secrets
#
# Environment variables (ADMIN_KEY and anything you add later) live in Val Town's
# UI, not in a file — so there is normally nothing to leak here. This covers the
# case where you create a local .env for testing.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*